		{
			dependencies: ["475DA94832CDDEB7"]
			description: [
				"two &cfire essentia&r plus one each of &9water&r/&2earth&r/&7air&r, plus blaze powder, coal, and occultism's &dotherworld essence&r, brew into four &6fire charges&r in the cauldron. a fire charge lights a nether portal on right-click -- no flint and steel required."
				""
				"the tech tree reaches the nether through metallurgy. this skips all of it."
