			description: [
				"magichem's &6alembic&r decomposes ordinary items into essentia -- coal, dirt, feathers, and the like break down into &cfire&r/&2earth&r/&7air&r/&9water&r essentia. wisdom 0, no wisdom stone needed, entry tier."
				""
				"brew spares. essentia are the base of this whole tree."
