			description: [
				"this is the magic side: no boilers, no voltage, no soot -- cauldrons, essentia, life essence, and rituals. three pillars carry the tree: &6mana & artifice&r (manaweaving/wands), &4blood magic&r (the LP economy), and &dmagichem&r (essentia/alembic)."
				""
				"magic and tech trade materials constantly in this pack. even a pure mage should check the other book now and then."
